                "instr": "Questions 1–5<br>Complete the notes below.<br>Write <b>ONE WORD ONLY</b> for each answer.",
                "type": "html",
                "html": "<p><b>Poppy Reserve</b></p>\n<p>Almond Valley Poppy Reserve is a nature reserve</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The poppies will be at their best at the end of the [[1]].</li>\n<li>The poppies on the hills are [[2]] in colour.</li>\n<li>The reserve is located to the [[3]] of Lakeside.</li>\n<li>The best time for photography is mid-afternoon.</li>\n<li>Wear [[4]] because of rattlesnakes.</li>\n<li>The reserve is a [[5]] park.</li>\n</ul>"
