                "html": "<table class=\"grid\">\n<tr><th>Tour</th><th>Start time</th><th>Duration</th><th>Highlights</th><th>Photography</th></tr>\n<tr><td>The [[6]] tour</td><td>Every hour from 7:30 a.m.</td><td>30 minutes</td><td>Viewpoints, film and the [[7]]</td><td>Panoramic pictures</td></tr>\n<tr><td>The wildflower tour</td><td>Every two hours from 8:00 a.m.</td><td>[[8]]</td><td>Poppy, cream cup, and sage</td><td>Close-up tips</td></tr>\n<tr><td>The wildlife tour</td><td>[[9]] a.m. or 7:00 p.m.</td><td>1.5 hours</td><td>Coyote, quail, roadrunners</td><td>Bring tripod and a [[10]] lens</td></tr>\n</table>"
