                "html": "<p><b>MAKING AN IRON AGE ROUNDHOUSE</b></p>\n<div class=\"flow\">\n<div>Mark centre of planned house with a [[16]]</div>\n<div>↓</div>\n<div>Mark out circle for outer boundary</div>\n<div>↓</div>\n<div>Dig ground using tools made from [[17]]</div>\n<div>↓</div>\n<div>Insert wall posts (Iron Age builders preferred wood from oak trees)</div>\n<div>↓</div>\n<div>Slot more stakes into upright posts</div>\n<div>↓</div>\n<div>Insert centre post and build a wooden [[18]] around it</div>\n<div>↓</div>\n<div>Add main supporting beams and ring beams</div>\n<div>↓</div>\n<div>Complete roof framework using [[19]] wood rods</div>\n<div>↓</div>\n<div>Cover roof with reed bundles of [[20]] lengths</div>\n<div>↓</div>\n<div>Daub with mixture of clay, dung and straw</div>\n</div>"
