            "script": "<p>Part 2. You will hear the manager of the Linwood apartment complex introducing the complex to a group of new residents.</p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(6:48 - 7:32)</span> First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 14. Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 14. Good afternoon, everyone.</p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(7:33 - 7:41)</span> Thank you for coming to the meeting. My name is Bob McDonald, and I'm the manager of the Linwood apartment complex. Firstly, I'd like to welcome you all.</p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(7:41 - 7:55)</span> I'm sure you'll enjoy living here. Let's start with a little bit of history about the Linwood apartments. The council first discussed the concept of this project five years ago, but there was a small delay initially while plans and administration were completed.</p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(7:56 - 8:16)</span> Work finally started three years later, <b data-q=\"11\">and one year ago the complex was finished and received its first residents</b>, and I'm happy to say it's been a great place to live ever since. So now just a little bit more about my role within the complex. I'm responsible for ensuring that rent is paid on time, but I can't say I get a lot of satisfaction from that aspect of the job.</p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(8:18 - 8:36)</span> Fortunately, because the building is quite new, there is generally little to do to keep everything in good working order. <b data-q=\"12\">What I love is working with the people who live here, especially helping neighbours deal with any little misunderstandings that might come up between them.</b> We want you to feel at home here, but there are some restrictions on what you can do.</p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(8:37 - 9:05)</span> <b data-q=\"13\">You're welcome to redecorate inside your apartment if you don't like the colour, but you can't change the outward appearance of the building in any way</b>, and that also includes altering the plantings around the complex by putting in your own trees or flowers. Now some of you were asking earlier about the welcome party. That will be held as planned next Friday evening, and we'll be doing all the catering so that there are no worries about food, but <b data-q=\"14\">it would be great if you could come along for a while on the day of the party to help put some party lights in the hall.</b></p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(9:06 - 9:55)</span> When you arrive, you'll find there are badges already prepared for everybody, so one will have your name on it. Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 15 to 20. Now listen and answer questions 15 to 20.</p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(9:58 - 10:19)</span> Now if you'd all like to have a look at your map of the apartment complex, I'll just go over where you can find all the facilities. The complex is a pedestrian area, so you can park your car here in the car park at the bottom of the map. There are two main apartment blocks, blue and red, with an open walkway up the middle called the arcade.</p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(10:21 - 10:49)</span> When you first arrive, you'll probably want to know where the shop is, <b data-q=\"15\">so if you go up from the car park into the arcade, you'll find the shop at the end on the right, opposite the internet cafe.</b> One popular attraction, especially in summer, is the barbecue area, so <b data-q=\"16\">if you walk from the car park and through the arcade, then turn right and follow the path, you'll see it at the end.</b> For those of you with young children, we have an excellent childcare centre.</p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(10:50 - 11:14)</span> From the car park, head north, but before you get to the arcade, turn left and follow the path around <b data-q=\"17\">until you reach the pond. You'll find it opposite the pond, on the west side of the blue block.</b> Now if you need to use the laundry, <b data-q=\"18\">walk up from the car park and into the arcade, look on your left and you'll see the gym, but keep going, and it's directly next door to that.</b></p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(11:15 - 11:25)</span> You all need to know where the recreation room is. Head north from the car park and take the first turning on the right. <b data-q=\"19\">Go straight on to the end and you'll find two buildings facing each other.</b></p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(11:26 - 11:47)</span> You want the one to the north, opposite the cafe. Finally, for the welcome party in the hall next week, from the car park, <b data-q=\"20\">go straight on to the end of the arcade, but then don't go too far, take the path up to the left, and it's at the end of that path, just above the trees on your map.</b> Well, I look forward to welcoming you all.</p>\n<p><span class=\"ts\">(11:50 - 12:50)</span> That is the end of Part 2. You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to Part 2.</p>"
