                "html": "<p><b>Renfrew Activity Centre</b></p>\n<table class=\"grid\">\n<tr><th>Activity</th><th>Location</th><th>Basic skill learned</th><th>Price per person</th><th>Price includes</th></tr>\n<tr><td><i>Example</i><br><b>Rock climbing</b></td><td>Centre grounds</td><td>using the [[1]]</td><td>£60 (for a group of twelve)</td><td>[[2]]</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Mountain biking</b></td><td>in the mountains</td><td>doing [[3]] checks</td><td>£70</td><td>services of a [[4]]</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Wild camping</b></td><td>in the [[5]]</td><td>finding out about plants</td><td>£50</td><td>Accommodation in tents</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Hill walking</b></td><td>in the National Park</td><td>[[6]] skills</td><td>£90</td><td>[[7]]</td></tr>\n</table>"
