                "type": "html",
                "html": "<p><b>Booking information</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Deposit for group booking: [[8]] of full amount</li>\n<li>Must bring suitable [[9]]</li>\n<li>Name of contact: Gordon [[10]]</li>\n</ul>"
